# SDD: Source inventory — cronus-ui @ b9c8635
status: inventoried
authority: migration-source
date: 2026-09-08

Product: **product UI system** (ADR 0003). Version **0.7.3**.
Barrel: `packages/ui/src/index.ts`. Contract: `CONTRACT.md` (gated by `scripts/contract-check.mjs`).

## Tokens / theme / looks

- Themes: aurora, neutral, midnight, sunset, emerald
- Modes: light, dark (10 combinations)
- Looks (ADR 0004, orthogonal): default, brutalist, glass → `data-cronus-look`
- Provider: `CronusUIProvider` (`asRoot`, `overrides`, `storageKey`)
- Script: `CronusThemeScript` (FOUC)
- CSS vars: `--cronus-*`

## CLI (`cronus-ui`)

init, add, compose, add-page, list, diff, upgrade, theme set, theme add, ai

Templates: saas (default, ADR 0007), store, landing*, mail, chat, finance, admin, docs

## Apps / tooling

- apps/www :4747 OSS docs
- apps/pro :4748 Pro origin — **inventory only until in-scope decision**
- stack, ai-kit, mcp, create-cronus-app, create-cronus-stack
- registry generated; do not hand-edit
- examples: smoke-next, smoke-vite
- e2e: axe, contrast×10, visual gallery, keyboard, looks

## Forms / charts (libs to replace, not embed)

- Form: RHF + optional Zod resolver. Field works without RHF.
- DataTable: TanStack Table
- Charts: Recharts (main barrel) AND visx (`@cronus-ui/ui/charts`)
- Motion: `motion` (Framer) + presets
- Overlays: Radix / vaul / cmdk / sonner

